        "type": "Module",
        "name": "power_5v",
        "description": "TPS54331 buck converter stage that steps the external VIN_12V rail down to VCC_5V as the first stage of the cascade. This module is the sole provider of the 5V rail and feeds the downstream 3.3V regulator. EN provides the converter enable policy and should be configured for intended always-on operation from the 12V input. VSENSE closes the 5V regulation loop and BOOT/PH/COMP/SS belong to the local switching, compensation, and soft-start network added later. This module owns the VCC_5V power output for downstream distribution.",
        "id": "power_5v"
      },
